{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Puppet Saurus&quot; is a two-player co-op action game that you control a kaiju by pulling him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Control by 2 players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455220/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1740514265\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your companions are slightly ugly but cute kaiju.<br>To control them, you need to divide up the roles, such as one person moving the legs and the other shooting fireballs.<br>Work together in unison!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Flashy kaiju actions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455220/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1740514265\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By pulling the kaiju, you can perform various actions.<br>Defeat enemies, eat and carry things, shoot lasers, etc.<br>Use a variety of actions to clear the game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2455220?t=1740514265","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2455220?t=1740514265","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455220/8376a29aea622cdb9ba983d9809e997960bf0963/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740514265","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455220/8376a29aea622cdb9ba983d9809e997960bf0963/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740514265","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Puppet Saurus&quot; is a two-player co-op action game that you control a kaiju by pulling him.<